## ⚙️ Customization & Configuration

All scripts include a **Configuration** section at the top where you can adjust:

* **Grid & resolution**: spatial (`x_lim`, `y_lim`), temporal (`t_lim`), propagation (`z_lim`).
* **Beam parameters**: wavelength (`λ`), waist size (`w0`), OAM order (`ℓ`), pulse duration.
* **Turbulence settings**: Rytov variance (`σ_R^2`), inner/outer scale, number of phase screens.
* **Simulation controls**: number of Monte Carlo realizations, recursion depth, solver options.
* **Plot toggles**: enable/disable intermediate plotting, color maps, figure sizes.

Simply open the script in any text or notebook editor and modify the top block—no code changes needed.

